    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "Start here \u00b7 compare Real-ESRGAN",
      "pos": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        2150,
        290
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 4,
      "mode": 0,
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Local cleanup comparison: original 256px vs Real-ESRGAN 2x (512px). Requires Genereti companion + native image dependencies on macOS 14+ Apple silicon.\n1. Download SDXS with its \u2193 and Real-ESRGAN with the upscaler \u2193. Downloads are explicit, public, anonymous and verified. Nothing starts on workflow load.\n2. Keep delivery Live. Start SDXS \u25b6, then upscale \u25b6. Both previews hold their latest completed image. The native live worker processes one request at a time; waiting source frames are replaced.\n3. Compare AnimeVideo and General. Use source for same-size cleanup, 2x for projection, or 4x for a larger output. Inputs must be at most 512px.\n4. Two passes add same-image refinement: upscale, downsample, blend with original, upscale again. Feedback controls the blend and has no previous-frame history. Start with one pass for speed.\n5. Pause both nodes before queued testing. Set source, generator and upscaler delivery to Comfy Queue and use Comfy Run. ? opens documentation with credits and licenses."
      ]
    },
